Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.09,0:00:23.13,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,{\fscx71.9\fscy119\an8\pos(960,-32.8)}Bom, vocês de fato se dão bem, não?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.13,0:00:23.17,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,{\fscx58\fscy129\an8\pos(960,-76)}Bom, vocês de fato se dão bem, não?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.41,0:00:25.59,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Mas é claro que não!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.51,0:00:29.88,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Parece que nós finalmente concordamos em algo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.30,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,É o que parece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.30,0:00:32.43,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Só tem uma coisa a fazer agora...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:33.86,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Estamos acabadas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:37.35,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,{\pos(620,1020)}Quem conversar com a outra primeiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:37.35,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,{\pos(1370,1020)}...perde, ok?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.71,0:00:39.24,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Isso não é o tipo de coisa que...?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:42.40,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,É algo que você só consegue fazer\Nse estiver em bons termos com a outra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:43.66,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,O-o quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:45.57,Black,Mejiro McQueen,0,0,0,,P-porque vocês estão olhando para nós?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:54.83,Black,Twin Turbo,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.23,0:00:58.19,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.73,0:00:59.79,Black,Twin Turbo,0,0,0,,O q-?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:03.99,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:06.42,Black,Twin Turbo,0,0,0,,Hm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.99,0:01:15.64,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,{\blur0\c&H000000&\t(2750,3084,1,\blur3\bord3)}A-ainda não terminei!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.99,0:01:15.64,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\4a&HFF&\t(2750,3084,1,\blur3)}A-ainda não terminei!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:21.35,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Ah, que coisa, ela está forçando demais de novo... n-não que eu me importe!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.39,0:01:26.05,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Força é tudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.86,0:01:31.36,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Que coisa, treinar desse jeito não é bom, estúpida.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.33,0:01:33.57,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.33,Black,Twin Turbo,0,0,0,,{\t(1855,2147,1,\c&H000000&)}T-tem algo de errado com elas!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.00,0:01:46.42,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Viu...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.78,0:01:49.64,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Pense mais no seu treino!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.67,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Eu achei que estávamos acabadas?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:57.39,Black,Daiwa Scarlet,0,0,0,,Huh?! Você falou comigo primeiro!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.39,0:01:59.39,Black,Vodka,0,0,0,,Não, você que falou!
